{"title":"Elder Treant","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 32 Treant that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">freeze</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\">Special: regrowthFracPerSec: .015</p>\n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/elder-treant\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/elder-treant?lv=32\">Lv 32</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/elder-treant?lv=53\">Lv 53 <span>5</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/elder-treant?lv=32\" title=\"Pick level 32\"><td><b>32</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>131</td><td>22.1</td><td>1,600</td><td class=\"muted\">393 · 30.9 · 4,800</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/elder-treant\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>53</b></td><td>344</td><td>33.7</td><td>2,650</td><td class=\"muted\">1,032 · 47.2 · 7,950</td><td>5</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 1 looted corpse recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"ancient-acorn\" title=\"Ancient Acorn - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 3 total, 3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/c59d042d73ed09af3407.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ancient Acorn</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×3</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"heartwood\" title=\"Heartwood - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 2 total, 2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/c2302e323c4a34ad089a.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Heartwood</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"shagbark-staff\" title=\"Shagbark Staff (staff-fire x1) - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/ebc76f546f7e78794d2e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Shagbark Staff</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1 · Enchanted: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>The Matriarch&#39;s Roost</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 5</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"5101\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(1)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/the-hollow-oak\"><img src=\"data/img/d7012420285a5f332d33.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>The Hollow Oak</b><span>Lv 53</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Treant: <a href=\"#/monster/sapling-treant\">Sapling Treant</a> <span class=\"muted\">(20)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/oakheart-treant\">Oakheart Treant</a> <span class=\"muted\">(26)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/d7012420285a5f332d33.webp\" alt=\"Elder Treant\"></div><h3>Elder Treant</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>53</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 32)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Treant</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>crush · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>344</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>33.7</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>2,650</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.8 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>1 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}